[statement]
Every version a repository offers is a candidate, not only the latest: a
dependency on `foo<2` is met by `foo` 1.5 when 1.5 and 2.1 are offered.

[repository]
P:b
V:1.0-r0
D:foo<2

P:foo
V:1.5-r0

P:foo
V:2.1-r0

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install foo 1.5-r0
install b 1.0-r0
